WEBVTT

00:10.810 --> 00:12.740
Mm, indeed!

00:13.880 --> 00:14.860
Let us begin!

00:15.140 --> 00:19.280
Welcome to my all-too-beautiful
makeup class!

00:20.460 --> 00:22.200
Makeup? And me?

00:22.200 --> 00:24.080
Let's do this.

00:24.080 --> 00:26.320
Make... ueen...

00:27.040 --> 00:29.650
"I will be the beauty queen."

00:29.650 --> 00:32.880
Question, ma'am!
Tell me more about anti-aging!

00:32.880 --> 00:33.310
It is the power to stop time.

00:33.310 --> 00:34.610
- Rentaro, look forward to beautiful result!
It is the power to stop time.

00:34.610 --> 00:35.420
- Rentaro, look forward to beautiful result!
- I see!

00:35.420 --> 00:36.270
- Rentaro, look forward to beautiful result!
- "The World."

00:36.270 --> 00:36.860
- Rentaro, look forward to beautiful result!
- Begin with the face roller!

00:36.860 --> 00:37.680
- Sure.
- Begin with the face roller!

00:38.250 --> 00:43.310
They're so driven when they're already
the most attractive girls in the world.

00:43.310 --> 00:44.770
I gotta keep up, too.

00:45.390 --> 00:49.600
I should go on a light
42.195 km jog when I'm home.

00:53.090 --> 00:55.650
Oh, that's Kakure Meme-san from our class.

00:56.380 --> 01:00.170
We've never talked, but her design
sure leaves an impression.

01:02.750 --> 01:04.540
Talk about windy.

01:05.840 --> 01:07.050
- What's wrong—
- My bangs... My bangs!

01:07.050 --> 01:08.620
- My bangs... My bangs!

01:08.620 --> 01:10.670
Missing the panties for the bangs!

01:10.670 --> 01:12.260
Huh? Eek!

01:12.260 --> 01:13.720
Oh, s-sorry!

01:13.720 --> 01:15.630
N-No! Not like this!

01:16.100 --> 01:17.690
But my bangs!

01:17.690 --> 01:18.760
But your bangs?!

01:19.720 --> 01:21.600
Watch out! A sign!

01:21.600 --> 01:23.150
But my bangs...

01:23.150 --> 01:24.230
But your bangs!

01:24.930 --> 01:27.480
What? Are they trying to kill Kakure-san?!

01:27.480 --> 01:28.910
But my bangs!

01:28.910 --> 01:30.230
But your bangs!

01:31.480 --> 01:32.730
Take me home—

01:33.980 --> 01:36.860
Krrrack!

01:39.030 --> 01:40.620
Are your bangs okay?

01:40.620 --> 01:42.490
Wait, no... Are you okay?!

01:42.490 --> 01:45.710
Y-Yes, thank you.

01:57.080 --> 01:58.810
It's that zing again.

02:00.330 --> 02:01.260
Kakure-san...

02:01.260 --> 02:03.510
But my bangs!

02:03.840 --> 02:05.340
But your bangs!

02:19.740 --> 02:24.950
(The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really,
Really, Really, REALLY Love You)

02:25.780 --> 02:28.620
(Karane
as the Tsundere Princess)

02:28.620 --> 02:30.910
(Demonstration
Tea-Time Prep)

02:30.910 --> 02:32.500
(Hakari
Suggestive Weight-Loss Running)

02:32.500 --> 02:33.750
(Kurumi
Ate all of the school store's bread)

02:33.750 --> 02:35.250
(Mimimi
(Getting ready) Two hours later)

02:36.420 --> 02:38.960
(Nano
Robot that exercises for her)

02:38.960 --> 02:41.380
(Shizuka
Has 365 book recommendations this week)

02:41.380 --> 02:43.680
(Kusuri
Has newly developed drug
that gives you sweet dreams)

02:43.680 --> 02:44.340
(Hahari
Chairperson's Address "Education" and "Love")

02:44.340 --> 02:45.010
(Iku
Has been doing push-ups since yesterday)

02:45.010 --> 02:46.550
(Meme
Customized Plushy- Rentaro-kun)

02:46.680 --> 02:51.390
(Rentaro-kun Appreciation Opening)

02:54.140 --> 02:55.810
(Meme-san added ears
and a tail for you!)

03:01.440 --> 03:03.490
(Rentaro-kun (& Others) Appreciation Opening)

03:38.230 --> 03:42.620
I'm sorry. I haven't even
thanked you for saving me yet.

03:42.620 --> 03:44.740
It's fine, as long as you're okay.

03:45.020 --> 03:48.990
I'm just... extremely shy.

03:48.990 --> 03:54.000
I can't deal with people looking
at me—or worse, seeing my face.

03:54.430 --> 03:57.090
I have to keep it hidden under my bangs.

03:57.090 --> 04:00.840
Oh... but your safety comes first.

04:00.840 --> 04:03.130
Of course. Second only to my bangs.

04:04.620 --> 04:07.890
Thank you so much, Aijo-kun.

04:08.160 --> 04:12.040
Oh, uh... We're in the same class...

04:12.040 --> 04:13.890
I know. Kakure-san, right?

04:13.890 --> 04:15.950
Yes. Wait...

04:15.950 --> 04:18.820
You can perceive me?

04:18.820 --> 04:20.400
What are you, some kind of ghost?

04:20.400 --> 04:25.040
I've been hiding my face to
blend in as a nameless extra...

04:25.040 --> 04:27.530
I feel like that's
kind of a standout feature.

04:28.280 --> 04:33.490
What? I'm just trying
to live an unassuming life!

04:33.490 --> 04:35.540
Maybe try a less unusual haircut.

04:35.930 --> 04:36.790
But...

04:37.690 --> 04:39.880
If I try other options,

04:39.880 --> 04:41.530
they attract even more attention.

04:41.530 --> 04:43.420
Bangs over lucha libre!

04:43.950 --> 04:47.430
It's kind of a shame, though.

04:48.530 --> 04:52.430
I caught a glimpse of your eyes between
your hair, and they were really pretty.

04:52.770 --> 04:56.190
Huh? P-P-P-Please!

05:00.120 --> 05:01.030
She vanished?

05:02.280 --> 05:03.800
Does she have superpowers?

05:04.280 --> 05:05.290
Morning.

05:08.880 --> 05:10.000
What is this?

05:12.910 --> 05:14.320
To Aijo-kun.

05:14.320 --> 05:18.370
Thank you so much for your help yesterday.

05:18.370 --> 05:23.280
It's not much, but I knitted this toy
for you as a token of my gratitude.

05:23.900 --> 05:26.130
I hope I'm not being a nuisance.

05:26.130 --> 05:28.680
If I am, feel free to leave this
in my shoe locker!

05:28.680 --> 05:29.800
Kakure.

05:30.050 --> 05:31.140
Hngh!

05:33.790 --> 05:34.790
Kakure-san.

05:35.140 --> 05:36.640
Thank you for the toy—

05:37.240 --> 05:38.560
She vanished again!

05:39.810 --> 05:41.070
Kakure-san—

05:41.710 --> 05:42.570
Kakure—

05:42.570 --> 05:44.970
Kakure-san!

05:46.200 --> 05:48.820
Why? Is she avoiding me?

05:49.160 --> 05:50.060
Girls...

05:50.570 --> 05:53.330
Do you know anything
about Kakure-san in our class?

05:53.710 --> 05:55.710
The human who hides her eyes with bangs.

05:55.710 --> 05:59.280
Ah. I've heard she's actually pretty cute.

05:59.280 --> 06:02.090
"Rumors say her parents are pretty faces."

06:02.360 --> 06:07.550
She's got an amazing body, too.
Estimated to be a G-cup, just like me.

06:07.550 --> 06:11.470
Isn't that crazy?
We're talking about Gs in high school!

06:11.470 --> 06:12.040
Wha?

06:12.040 --> 06:14.800
G-cup. Do you even understand
what that means?

06:14.800 --> 06:15.630
G...

06:15.630 --> 06:17.980
Gee golly, shut up with all the Gs!

06:18.350 --> 06:22.360
"Pretty face." "Amazing body." "Rumors."

06:23.860 --> 06:27.560
Those are qualities
most people would kill for,

06:27.560 --> 06:30.780
but Kakure-san didn't choose
to be born like this.

06:31.330 --> 06:36.620
Shy as she is, they must cause her
nothing but suffering.

06:37.090 --> 06:38.870
That's why she hides it all.

06:39.120 --> 06:40.620
I was too thoughtless.

06:45.980 --> 06:48.130
If she'll vanish once I get too close...

06:49.630 --> 06:51.390
Sorry, Kakure-san!

06:51.650 --> 06:55.140
I thoughtlessly called you cute yesterday,

06:55.650 --> 06:58.400
when I knew how shy you were!

06:58.400 --> 06:59.390
N-No...

06:59.390 --> 07:04.150
It's not what you think.
I'm not mad at you, Aijo-kun.

07:04.700 --> 07:09.590
I'm just too embarrassed
to face you in person.

07:10.570 --> 07:11.500
Sorry.

07:11.500 --> 07:14.410
It must be because I'm still...

07:15.160 --> 07:17.410
...thinking you're cute in my mind!

07:17.770 --> 07:19.580
Maybe if I gouge my eyes out.

07:19.580 --> 07:21.460
Huh? Please don't!

07:21.460 --> 07:22.920
It's not what you think!

07:22.920 --> 07:24.170
The thing is...

07:27.150 --> 07:31.590
I'm in love with you, Aijo-kun.

07:32.980 --> 07:37.180
N-No... What did I just...

07:37.470 --> 07:40.040
Kakure-san—oh, not again!

07:43.050 --> 07:44.450
I'm over here.

07:44.450 --> 07:45.480
When'd that happen?

07:46.200 --> 07:48.480
Have you ever heard of misdirection?

07:49.230 --> 07:53.240
Using a diversion to take attention
off whatever you're doing.

07:53.970 --> 07:58.740
It's a psychological trick used by the
main character of Kuroko's Basketball.

07:59.070 --> 08:01.870
Must be where our writer got it from.

08:02.260 --> 08:04.960
When I get too embarrassed,

08:04.960 --> 08:09.880
I throw dolls as misdirection
and hide on instinct.

08:09.880 --> 08:16.140
Right. There isn't a soul on earth who
wouldn't be distracted by those cute dolls.

08:16.450 --> 08:20.240
I could never fall in love
when I'm like this.

08:20.240 --> 08:23.770
Too shy to talk,
go on dates, or hold hands...

08:23.770 --> 08:27.150
I would simply get embarrassed and vanish.

08:27.150 --> 08:31.500
So I never intended to
tell you how I feel.

08:32.600 --> 08:36.530
I'm sorry.
Please forget what I said before.

08:36.890 --> 08:39.070
Don't say such depressing things.

08:39.920 --> 08:42.160
Don't say you can't fall in love.

08:42.160 --> 08:45.930
Or that I should forget
what you said and how you feel.

08:46.420 --> 08:47.420
Because...

08:48.740 --> 08:50.670
I love you too, Kakure-san!

08:51.650 --> 08:53.300
B-B...

08:53.300 --> 08:54.680
B-B-B-B-B...

08:54.680 --> 08:56.930
But...!

08:59.750 --> 09:01.430
After that day...

09:06.940 --> 09:11.460
she would never be seen again.

09:12.540 --> 09:14.860
The first girlfriend
that he couldn't save.

09:15.380 --> 09:16.200
Next time:

09:16.560 --> 09:20.270
The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really,
Really, Really, REALLY Love You...

09:20.270 --> 09:21.160
The Final Episode.

09:21.160 --> 09:24.200
Screw this stupid script!
I'm gonna change it all!

09:24.200 --> 09:26.210
Kakure-san!

09:28.150 --> 09:32.710
Her shoes are still in her locker,
so she couldn't have gone home.

09:33.030 --> 09:35.170
Is she moving around?

09:35.170 --> 09:39.340
But I should've run into her unless
she was keeping tabs on my location.

09:39.340 --> 09:41.710
Wait, there is one place.

09:41.710 --> 09:46.260
Somewhere she'd always know
where I was without being spotted by me.

09:46.260 --> 09:47.100
And that's...

09:49.350 --> 09:50.110
I knew it.

09:50.590 --> 09:53.140
She was there the whole time... behind me!

09:54.680 --> 09:57.680
Nope.
She vanishes as soon as I turn around.

09:57.680 --> 09:58.740
In that case...

09:59.000 --> 10:00.240
Battle of attrition!

10:01.580 --> 10:02.080
I'll do it.

10:03.040 --> 10:04.750
I will find you!

10:04.750 --> 10:07.750
I won't be fooled by your misdirection!

10:18.980 --> 10:19.970
Found you.

10:21.170 --> 10:23.220
H-How?

10:23.220 --> 10:24.470
I knew it.

10:24.910 --> 10:29.700
Of course she'd be out of breath
after all that zooming around.

10:29.700 --> 10:32.770
Eventually, all I needed to do
was follow her breathing.

10:33.370 --> 10:37.230
I don't care how shy you are,
where you hide away,

10:37.230 --> 10:39.360
or how many times you hide away.

10:39.360 --> 10:41.180
I will find you.

10:42.250 --> 10:46.160
So you can fall in love,
I promise you that.

10:46.480 --> 10:51.420
Wh-What? Are you really... really sure?

10:51.730 --> 10:56.800
Am I really good enough
when I can't even show my face?

10:56.800 --> 10:59.560
I love you because of the way you are.

11:00.180 --> 11:01.550
Please be my girlfriend?

11:01.550 --> 11:04.940
O-Oh... I'd love to.

11:06.100 --> 11:07.060
"Rip"?

11:09.200 --> 11:10.690
N-No...

11:11.020 --> 11:14.070
I ran around so much, my binder...!

11:14.070 --> 11:15.440
- R-Right.
I ran around so much, my binder...!

11:15.440 --> 11:18.050
"Pretty face," with an "amazing body."

11:18.050 --> 11:20.570
And she hides her face, so of course
she'd hide her body too!

11:20.570 --> 11:23.320
E-Eek!

11:23.810 --> 11:25.950
Gah! And I just found her!

11:26.280 --> 11:27.180
Kakure Meme.

11:27.180 --> 11:29.820
Her true power level exceeded a G.

11:30.980 --> 11:32.020
Better luck next time.

11:34.050 --> 11:35.960
And there you have it.

11:36.410 --> 11:41.730
May I have your permission to welcome
Kakure Meme-san as my newest girlfriend?

11:41.730 --> 11:43.220
Is this girlfriend in the room with us?

11:43.220 --> 11:46.800
S-Sorry, I'm scared of being seen.

11:46.800 --> 11:47.600
She is!

11:47.890 --> 11:50.600
My hobby is knitting.

11:51.290 --> 11:56.430
I knitted dolls for all of you based on
what Rentaro-kun's told me.

11:57.630 --> 11:58.860
Cute!

11:58.860 --> 12:00.490
What a wonderful gift.

12:00.770 --> 12:01.620
Moon.

12:01.620 --> 12:02.650
Kitty cat.

12:02.650 --> 12:03.570
Peacock!

12:03.570 --> 12:05.120
Nappies!

12:05.120 --> 12:07.730
Amazing you can make these!

12:07.730 --> 12:09.520
Yeah, you're amazing!

12:09.520 --> 12:11.710
P... P-P-Please!

12:12.670 --> 12:13.710
A vanishing pitch?!

12:13.710 --> 12:14.730
Get back here!

12:14.730 --> 12:16.340
Settle down.

12:16.340 --> 12:18.090
"Drop the weapon."

12:18.410 --> 12:20.600
Sorry, I'm over here.

12:20.600 --> 12:24.090
Meme-chan's a shy girl
with a tendency to hide.

12:24.090 --> 12:25.230
Huh?

12:25.230 --> 12:28.120
How am I supposed to
see her underwear, then?

12:28.120 --> 12:31.850
You can dream about it in prison tonight.

12:31.850 --> 12:36.120
Also, I have to keep my face hidden...

12:36.120 --> 12:39.610
I'll try not to be a bother
and stay out of everyone's way.

12:40.090 --> 12:42.060
Huh? Why're you being so...

12:42.060 --> 12:43.360
You would never be a bother.

12:44.530 --> 12:49.240
Okay, since Meme-chan's so good at hiding,

12:49.240 --> 12:50.870
let's play schoolwide hide-and-seek.

12:51.310 --> 12:56.350
I'll be "it" at the start, and everyone
I find will become "it" too.

12:56.350 --> 12:58.380
The last one to be found wins.

12:58.380 --> 13:02.180
"And the winner will
receive a kiss from me."

13:02.180 --> 13:04.540
Who said you could mess with the rules?!

13:04.540 --> 13:05.960
Teehee.

13:05.960 --> 13:09.720
But I ain't taking it back.
Not on my soul.

13:09.720 --> 13:11.560
Y-You don't say.

13:11.920 --> 13:15.100
No hiding in locker rooms,
restrooms, or staff rooms.

13:15.100 --> 13:18.310
Also, no moving once you've
picked a hiding spot.

13:18.620 --> 13:22.070
But "schoolwide"?
That sounds like suffering for you.

13:22.360 --> 13:23.390
Don't worry.

13:23.390 --> 13:26.820
I'd go to the ends of the earth
to find you.

13:27.200 --> 13:28.220
Hngh!

13:28.220 --> 13:30.080
We said "schoolwide," fool.

13:30.410 --> 13:32.700
Okay, the game starts now!

13:32.700 --> 13:33.930
Disperse!

13:35.110 --> 13:38.120
One, two, three...

13:38.610 --> 13:40.260
Three hundred.

13:40.260 --> 13:42.110
Okay, that's five minutes.

13:45.940 --> 13:48.040
Where's everyone?

13:50.830 --> 13:53.540
I'm surprised you picked
this spot too, Mei-san.

13:53.540 --> 13:57.730
Well, Hahari-sama ordered me
to hide with everything I have.

13:58.030 --> 14:00.210
This was a good pick.

14:00.210 --> 14:05.240
The pain I must endure to keep from
falling tells me I'm serving Hahari-sama.

14:05.550 --> 14:07.950
Isn't it great? I love the pain!

14:07.950 --> 14:09.110
Certainly!

14:09.110 --> 14:11.870
Hmm, I should check the gym storeroom.

14:11.870 --> 14:14.360
Good, keep going.

14:14.360 --> 14:15.610
What's the matter?

14:16.370 --> 14:19.160
You look like you're struggling,
Vice Principal.

14:19.160 --> 14:22.280
I'm just a little tired because
my body feels heavy.

14:22.280 --> 14:28.000
Picking up lost items and taking the boys'
goodies for myself sparks joy for me.

14:28.000 --> 14:29.020
Don't try to stop me!

14:29.020 --> 14:30.640
Just don't push yourself too hard.

14:33.390 --> 14:37.600
Why'd you pick the same spot as me,
you stupid hostile tsundere?!

14:37.600 --> 14:41.880
I said I was here first,
you perpetually horny seed garden!

14:42.910 --> 14:44.900
Anyone here?

14:46.340 --> 14:49.530
Now, where could you be?

14:53.060 --> 14:53.910
Hey!

14:54.300 --> 14:55.980
Why'd you follow me?!

14:55.980 --> 14:56.790
Right back at you!

14:57.050 --> 14:59.850
Wh-What's with her thighs?

14:59.850 --> 15:01.700
They're so soft and squishy.

15:01.700 --> 15:04.670
I-It's not like my heart is racing
or anything, okay?!

15:04.670 --> 15:07.280
I... I gotta get outta here!

15:08.000 --> 15:09.240
Karane-san?

15:09.240 --> 15:12.800
Why is she rubbing her cheeks
on my thighs?

15:14.200 --> 15:19.310
Her soft cheeks and silky hair
are tickling my privies!

15:20.040 --> 15:21.560
Stop moving, please.

15:21.920 --> 15:24.810
Hey! Why's she squishing me tighter?!

15:25.240 --> 15:27.380
Come on out.

15:27.380 --> 15:29.570
No... not so hard!

15:34.650 --> 15:37.330
They popped out like in Sazae-san's OP!

15:37.980 --> 15:39.930
E... E...

15:39.930 --> 15:41.450
Emeralds, indeed.

15:41.450 --> 15:43.760
D... Dosage, aye.

15:43.760 --> 15:46.250
E... Exercise, indeed.

15:46.250 --> 15:47.960
D... Depressant, aye.

15:47.960 --> 15:50.880
E... Electric jacket, indeed.

15:50.880 --> 15:53.050
D... Daytime cold medicine, aye.

15:53.050 --> 15:54.070
E...

15:57.230 --> 15:59.190
Oh, found...

16:00.420 --> 16:01.560
They're asleep!

16:01.560 --> 16:03.730
- Zzz, aye.
- Zzz, indeed.

16:03.730 --> 16:05.170
Sleeping faces!

16:07.470 --> 16:11.790
Oh, lying down in dark place
made Kusuri doze off...

16:11.790 --> 16:14.240
A fine bit of beauty sleep.

16:14.240 --> 16:17.230
Why are our seniors like this?

16:20.120 --> 16:22.760
There's a storeroom
in the back of the library?

16:22.760 --> 16:25.880
Shizuka-san, as a librarian,
would have known about it.

16:26.190 --> 16:30.880
But this place too dark
and scary for Shizuka, no?

16:31.230 --> 16:33.880
It's very well-maintained.

16:34.380 --> 16:38.740
Then why are there books on the floor?

16:38.740 --> 16:39.760
Point.

16:40.190 --> 16:43.390
Maybe they were somewhere else?

16:43.760 --> 16:47.150
Maybe they were
taken out of this box, for example.

16:47.150 --> 16:48.650
Then what will we find inside?

16:48.980 --> 16:50.900
Shizuka! Nano!

16:53.150 --> 16:55.910
The sweetest treasure box!

16:56.910 --> 16:59.640
Seriously, get away from me!

16:59.640 --> 17:03.380
Gosh, someone's in her rebellious phase.

17:04.120 --> 17:06.420
Maybe we'll find someone here as well.

17:06.420 --> 17:07.180
Shh!

17:07.180 --> 17:08.540
Sdop, wool!

17:09.290 --> 17:11.630
A sweet, floral scent...

17:11.630 --> 17:13.710
And round and smooth.

17:13.710 --> 17:15.800
Like two massive sakura daifuku.

17:16.110 --> 17:19.050
Hmm... Nobody here, I guess?

17:19.050 --> 17:19.940
They look yummy...

17:19.940 --> 17:20.910
I can't breathe.

17:20.910 --> 17:21.680
They look yummy!

17:21.680 --> 17:25.810
I'm fading out. They look so yummy!

17:26.160 --> 17:29.100
This will work, Kurumi-chan.
We can get through this.

17:32.570 --> 17:34.690
Whoo! Boob—

17:34.690 --> 17:35.070
Boob—

17:35.070 --> 17:36.920
Booby om-nom!

17:36.920 --> 17:39.070
- Found you, Hahari-san and Kurumi!
Booby om-nom!

17:40.820 --> 17:42.950
Wh-What's wrong, Hahari-san?!

17:42.950 --> 17:43.870
Kurumi?

17:44.610 --> 17:44.980
I didn't do nothing, I swear!

17:44.980 --> 17:46.540
- "Avert thy eyes."
I didn't do nothing, I swear!

17:46.540 --> 17:47.990
I didn't do nothing, I swear!

17:49.180 --> 17:52.460
That leaves just Iku,
Mei-san, and Meme-chan.

17:53.050 --> 17:55.350
Hm? Puddles?

17:57.220 --> 17:58.120
The pain!

17:58.120 --> 17:59.620
O-Orders...

17:59.620 --> 18:00.350
"Intruders."

18:00.350 --> 18:02.810
Found you, Iku and Mei-san.

18:02.810 --> 18:04.180
Good hiding.

18:05.990 --> 18:08.500
Now we're down to just Kakure-san.

18:08.500 --> 18:10.730
But there's nowhere left to search.

18:10.730 --> 18:14.230
And the rules say she's
not allowed to move after hiding.

18:15.260 --> 18:17.600
What happen, Vice Principal?

18:17.600 --> 18:19.650
She's still collecting lost items?

18:19.650 --> 18:21.430
That's a former track-and-field
athlete for you.

18:21.430 --> 18:23.340
I should learn from her mentality.

18:23.340 --> 18:25.630
Learn to chill out instead.

18:26.350 --> 18:31.250
Perhaps Kakure-sama is hiding
inside a moving object?

18:31.250 --> 18:37.130
Aha! So her hiding spot itself
is moving around, and not her?

18:37.130 --> 18:39.100
A beautiful application of wit!

18:39.100 --> 18:42.010
Vice Principal, may we take
a look inside the box?

18:42.340 --> 18:47.080
Sure, but I'm not giving
anything back. It's all mine.

18:47.080 --> 18:48.770
She isn't in here.

18:48.770 --> 18:52.380
Oh, sorry for bothering you.

18:52.380 --> 18:53.400
"You may pass."

18:56.420 --> 18:57.740
Vice Principal...

18:57.740 --> 19:03.690
Did you see a student embarrass themselves
and vanish right in front of your eyes?

19:03.690 --> 19:07.790
Y-Yes, a student told a bad pun
and vanished with her face beet red.

19:07.790 --> 19:11.920
Must've been the ghost of a girl
who died from telling the worst pun ever.

19:12.320 --> 19:13.390
Yep, I get it now.

19:13.390 --> 19:15.420
Huh? What do you get?

19:15.420 --> 19:16.550
I...

19:16.550 --> 19:18.050
get this!

19:20.120 --> 19:22.050
The Secret Fro of Kakuretty!

19:22.050 --> 19:24.170
I feel lighter now!

19:25.060 --> 19:27.550
Time to grab the sports teams' undies!

19:27.550 --> 19:29.060
Maybe I should fire her.

19:29.060 --> 19:30.630
And yourself.

19:31.060 --> 19:32.960
How'd you know?

19:32.960 --> 19:35.570
Because I saw this doll in the box.

19:36.030 --> 19:38.060
I figured it wasn't lost property,

19:38.060 --> 19:43.320
but a sign that Meme-chan used
misdirection on the vice principal.

19:44.190 --> 19:47.020
Anyway, found you, Meme-chan.

19:47.020 --> 19:48.700
And congrats on winning.

19:48.980 --> 19:52.460
Huh? S-Sorry it had to be me...

19:52.460 --> 19:54.080
Congratulations!

19:54.080 --> 19:55.770
A hider is you!

19:55.770 --> 19:56.820
Splendidly done.

19:56.820 --> 19:58.340
Your stealth is impressive.

19:58.340 --> 20:00.200
How did you train?

20:00.200 --> 20:01.930
"You're no amateur."

20:01.930 --> 20:03.340
I wanna lick her up.

20:03.340 --> 20:05.940
I-I guess you weren't half bad.

20:05.940 --> 20:08.720
Be proud of yourself for besting me!

20:08.990 --> 20:11.980
Huh? P-P-Please!

20:12.420 --> 20:13.190
She's gone!

20:13.900 --> 20:15.720
Sorry, I'm over here.

20:15.720 --> 20:17.290
Awesome!

20:17.290 --> 20:19.130
She really did vanish.

20:19.130 --> 20:21.190
I guess it worked out somewhat.

20:21.710 --> 20:27.790
Meme-chan was worried she wouldn't
fit in because of her eccentricities.

20:27.790 --> 20:31.840
But these girls would never
judge her for that.

20:32.270 --> 20:40.960
What she needed was confidence
that the family accepted and welcomed her.

20:41.290 --> 20:43.840
Well, go claim your kiss.

20:43.840 --> 20:47.150
Right. You won and all.

20:47.150 --> 20:50.470
What? B-But a kiss is too much.

20:50.470 --> 20:55.210
Kissing Rentaro-chan
is the best feeling in the world.

20:55.210 --> 20:56.300
Right?

20:56.300 --> 20:57.480
R-Right you are.

20:57.770 --> 21:01.730
"Of course, you are free
to decline if you so wish."

21:01.730 --> 21:04.490
W-Well, uh...

21:04.490 --> 21:10.260
I would certainly
l-like to myself... but...

21:10.260 --> 21:14.000
I bet I'll be embarrassed and disappear.

21:14.000 --> 21:18.780
How about we get Karane-san
to hold you down, then?

21:18.780 --> 21:21.600
She could even give a bear
a broken freaking neck.

21:21.600 --> 21:23.260
Maybe I'll try it out on you.

21:23.650 --> 21:27.120
No, even if I were tied down,

21:27.120 --> 21:31.620
if I got embarrassed I'd just
dislocate my joints and escape.

21:31.620 --> 21:33.020
Holy Houdini!

21:33.020 --> 21:35.760
It'd be awkward to kiss
in front of everyone.

21:35.760 --> 21:38.000
There's no reason to rush this.

21:38.000 --> 21:40.010
Maybe some other time.

21:40.010 --> 21:41.020
Fair.

21:41.560 --> 21:43.230
Okay, let's go home.

21:43.230 --> 21:44.780
Okay.

21:45.060 --> 21:47.230
Hide-and-seek was fun!

21:47.230 --> 21:49.010
We should do it again sometime.

21:49.010 --> 21:51.630
Next time, I'll hide until I break.

21:51.630 --> 21:53.290
Was it fun for you, Meme-chan?

21:53.290 --> 21:54.980
Y-Yes.

22:01.720 --> 22:03.800
Sorry for doing this out of the blue.

22:04.160 --> 22:08.830
But I figured I should kiss you before you
realized that you were embarrassed.

22:10.530 --> 22:11.680
Rentaro-kun?

22:12.080 --> 22:13.930
Why are you mumbling to yourself?

22:18.360 --> 22:19.940
Without a sound!
